  "description": "Be the first to know when items that are currently sold out will be back in stock. Sign up for alerts here.\nThanks to its comfortable geometry, lightweight tubing selection and excellent tire clearance, the Anticosti is created for long outings on backcountry roads, and for bikepacking or light touring missions.\nWith a custom selection of Reynolds 725 steel tubing for each frame size, the balance is struck between weight, comfort and performance. For this new generation, tire clearance is increased to 57mm (or 29x2.25″), internal cable routing for dropper is added and the UDH standard makes it easy to replace the derailleur hanger or use T-Type drivetrains.\nDo you want to optimize your bike's weight and performance, or would you prefer a fork that can adapt to every style of rack on the market? The Anticosti is now available in carbon or steel fork configurations.\n*The frameset comes complete with wheel axles, installed headset, seatpost collar and frame protectors.",
